  "text": "Urgent Concern Regarding Lab Result Routing and Privacy\n\nDear Support Team, we are writing to report a serious workflow issue regarding how incoming diagnostic results are signed off and routed. Earlier today, abnormal lab findings for a patient were inadvertently routed to a covering physician's queue while also appearing on an incorrect viewable list accessible by administrative staff members who should not be seeing such clinical details. We are deeply concerned about this breach of information and need immediate clarification on how to properly isolate abnormal result notifications and restrict sign-off permissions exclusively to licensed medical providers. Please contact us urgently to review our routing configuration and ensure patient data privacy is maintained."
